            "table": "Service | Time | Cost\nUK standard (Royal Mail Tracked or DPD) | 2 to 4 working days | £4.99, free over £79.99\nUK next working day (DPD) | Order by 2pm Mon to Thu | £6.99\nBelgium, France, Germany, Ireland, Netherlands, Spain // Duties covered up to €150 | 3 to 5 days | £5.99\nRest of Europe // Duties covered up to €150 for EU countries | 5 to 8 days | £8.99\nUSA | 5 to 8 days | £9.99\nAustralia | 4 to 7 days | £9.99\nCanada, New Zealand | 5 to 7 days | £14.99\nRest of world | 7 to 14 days | £19.99",
