            "content": "<ul><li><strong>UK:</strong> Returns must be requested within 14 days of delivery and sent back within 14 days of your request. <strong>International:</strong> Returns must be requested within 21 days of delivery.</li><li>Please return items unworn, unwashed and with all tags attached. We may reduce your refund if an item has been worn, washed or handled more than you would in a shop.</li><li>Return postage is the responsibility of the customer, unless the item is faulty or incorrect. Please use a tracked and signed for service.</li><li>Refunds are issued to the original payment method and include the standard delivery charge you paid on the order. If you chose a faster delivery option, we refund up to the cost of standard delivery. Store credit is available as an alternative when you start your return.</li><li>Faulty or incorrect items will be replaced or refunded in full.</li><li>For hygiene reasons, underwear and socks cannot be returned once the seal or packaging has been opened.</li><li>Returns are processed within 7 working days of arriving at our warehouse.</li></ul>",
